                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso kolimokis ikesisiak ice ŋes ebe, “Kianyu Ejakait.” Konye kotema atiar, “Arai mam eoŋ aanyunit apoorei nuka aseito kakaninike, ka aibwaikin da ikabokor apedon nuka aseito, ka aibwaikin akakan toma amaranake, mam eoŋ eyuuni nepetai da.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
